SUMMARY:You Can See Everything
LOCATION:Images Cinema\, 50 Spring St\, Williamstown\, MA 01267
DESCRIPTION:Times: 11:45am\, 3pm\, 6:15pm\nThirty-four days before she's se
 nt to prison\, notorious Silicon Valley founder Elizabeth Holmes invites a
  skeptical film crew to document her every move. What begins as an intimat
 e portrait of an enigmatic felon becomes a mind-bending three-year journey
  into the abyss.\nhttps://www.imagescinema.org/movie/you-can-see-everythin
 g\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.imagescinema.org/movie/you-can-see-everything
END:VEVENT
