SUMMARY:Godzilla Minus Zero
LOCATION:Images Cinema\, 50 Spring St\, Williamstown\, MA 01267
DESCRIPTION:Times: 12pm\, 3:15pm\, 6:30pm\, 9:45pm\nWar reduced Japan to ze
 ro\, and Godzilla plunged it into minus. Two years have passed since then\
 , and the country has faced agonizing struggles to achieve recovery and fi
 nally reclaim its daily life. Just as humanity managed to cling to a hard-
 won peace\, a new threat strikes\, crushing hope in an instant.\nhttps://w
 ww.imagescinema.org/movie/godzilla-minus-zero\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: 
 https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.imagescinema.org/movie/godzilla-minus-zero
END:VEVENT
