SUMMARY:Wild Horse Nine
LOCATION:Images Cinema\, 50 Spring St\, Williamstown\, MA 01267
DESCRIPTION:Times: 4:15pm\, 7pm\, 9:45pm\nShortly before the 1973 Chilean c
 oup\, CIA agents Chris and Lee are dispatched from Santiago to Easter Isla
 nd by their bureau chief\, MJ. Amongst the Island's iconic statues\, and a
 s the longtime partners wrestle with their dark pasts and present conspira
 cies\, Chris's newfound bond with a pair of rebellious students threatens 
 to send everyone’s trip to this remote paradise sideways.\nhttps://www.i
 magescinema.org/movie/wild-horse-nine\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://
 pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.imagescinema.org/movie/wild-horse-nine
END:VEVENT
