SUMMARY:Godzilla Minus Zero
LOCATION:Images Cinema\, 50 Spring St\, Williamstown\, MA 01267
DESCRIPTION:Times: 4:30pm\, 7:15pm\nWar reduced Japan to zero\, and Godzill
 a plunged it into minus. Two years have passed since then\, and the countr
 y has faced agonizing struggles to achieve recovery and finally reclaim it
 s daily life. Just as humanity managed to cling to a hard-won peace\, a ne
 w threat strikes\, crushing hope in an instant.\nhttps://www.imagescinema.
 org/movie/godzilla-minus-zero\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.
 city/westernma/
URL:https://www.imagescinema.org/movie/godzilla-minus-zero
END:VEVENT
