SUMMARY:Wild Horse Nine
LOCATION:Images Cinema\, 50 Spring St\, Williamstown\, MA 01267
DESCRIPTION:Times: 4:45pm\, 7:30pm\nShortly before the 1973 Chilean coup\, 
 CIA agents Chris and Lee are dispatched from Santiago to Easter Island by 
 their bureau chief\, MJ. Amongst the Island's iconic statues\, and as the 
 longtime partners wrestle with their dark pasts and present conspiracies\,
  Chris's newfound bond with a pair of rebellious students threatens to sen
 d everyone’s trip to this remote paradise sideways.\nhttps://www.imagesc
 inema.org/movie/wild-horse-nine\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpi
 n.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.imagescinema.org/movie/wild-horse-nine
END:VEVENT
